# Documentation

- Keep EN and FR guides in sync when changing behavior (`docs/en/*` ↔ `docs/fr/*`).
- Architectural invariants → `docs/*/decisions.md` (new `Dxx` row), then mirror day-to-day rules in `.cursor/rules/` (especially `CURSOR.mdc`) if agents must follow them every session.
- Do not resurrect long architecture/brand pages; prefer short guides + the decisions log.
- Agent learnings / blockers → `.cursor/memory/` (dated append).
- Never document secrets; point to `config.example.json` and userData paths only.
